## I FEEL LOVE (instrumental cover) for PULP/SKRED
#  128 BPM, C major, 96 bars (~3:00). Instrumental only, no vocals or lyrics.
#  Self-contained: drums are built-in waves 82-99.
#     [i_feel_love.sk] /ls      then:   play     (stop:  stop)
#
#  WHAT THE SOURCES SAID
#    - Tempo ~127-128 BPM, key C major (with sequential rises to Eb, F, G)
#    - Iconic sequenced bass: short-note cell C C G Bb (and transpositions)
#      doubled by delay for the classic strobe / flicker effect
#    - Four-on-the-floor kick + continuous off-beat hi-hat (proto techno/house)
#    - Moog-style bass with filter envelope, layered pads, key changes for variety
#  GUESSES (edit freely)
#    - exact section lengths and when the key rises occur
#    - soft lead contour approximating the vocal phrases
#    - mix levels and filter settings
#  UNTESTED and UNHEARD at the time of writing.
#
#  VOICE MAP
#    v0 kick   v1 snare   v2 closed hat   v3 open hat   v4 clap   v5 crash
#    v6 bass centre (saw + filter env) + v7 detuned partner (right)
#    v8 soft lead (centre) + v9/v10 detuned partners
#    v13 high arpeggio / sparkle
#    v16 riser (optional)
#    v24 pad LFO   v26-v27 pad prototype   v28-v37 pad pool
#  DELAY BUSES
#    1  bass stereo flicker (dotted 8th / ping-pong)
#    2  lead / pad wash
#    3  short slap for arps
#    4  riser / freeze bus
#  PATTERNS
#    0 conductor   1 kick   2 snare+clap   3 hats   6 main bass cell
#    7 key-rise bass   8 lead   9 high arp   11 pad   13 snare roll
#    14 pump   15 boom/impact   16 filter sweep
#  SECTIONS (bars)
#     0-7   intro bass + hats
#     8-15  drums in, pad, filter opens
#    16-31  verse A (C)
#    32-39  rise to Eb / F
#    40-55  chorus / "I feel love" feel
#    56-63  breakdown (delay freeze)
#    64-79  final chorus (full + key rise)
#    80-95  outro strip + freeze cleanup
# ======================================================================

[I FEEL LOVE] puts
M 128 16

## INLINE K-SYNTH (short riser / impact noise, stretched by playback rate)
[
N: 65536
T: !N
E: (e(T*(3.8%N)))%100
R: r T
L: 0.3 f R
H: R-L
F: 700*(e(T*(2.2%N)))*((p 2)%(p 0))
P: +\F
S: s P
W: w E*((S*.4)+(H*.55))
] k!
k>w301,44100,1

## DELAY BUSES
DS 1 128 .75
DL 1 - - 9 2 3 12
DD 1 6 2
DP 1 1
DS 2 128 .5
DL 2 - - 7 1 2 10
DD 2 7 3
DS 3 128 .25
DL 3 - - 4 0 0 8
DD 3 8 4
DS 4 128 1
DL 4 - - 11 3 6 11
DD 4 7 2
DP 4 1

